## Installation

### Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/SatwikisCringe/sbom-sentinel.git
```

---

## Backend Setup

```bash
cd backend

python -m venv venv

venv\Scripts\activate

pip install -r requirements.txt

uvicorn main:app --reload
```

Backend runs on

```
http://127.0.0.1:8000
```

Swagger API

```
http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs
```

---

## Frontend Setup

```bash
cd frontend

npm install

npm run dev
```

Frontend runs on

```
http://localhost:5173
```

---

## API Endpoints

### Upload Identity Events

```
POST /upload
```

Uploads an identity events CSV file for analysis.

---

### Dashboard Metrics

```
GET /dashboard
```

Returns

- Total Events
- Total Anomalies
- Critical Alerts
- High Risk Events
- Medium Risk Events
- Low Risk Events

---

### Health Check

```
GET /health
```

---

## Workflow

1. Start Backend
2. Start Frontend
3. Upload an Identity Events CSV
4. Backend analyzes the dataset
5. Dashboard updates automatically
6. Risk metrics are displayed
7. Risk distribution chart is generated

---

## Dashboard

The dashboard displays

- Total Events
- Total Anomalies
